and IND AS 36 "Impairment of assets" according to which
acquired Goodwill is not permitted to be amortised and is
required to be tested annually for impairment. The financial
impact of the aforesaid treatment has been disclosed in the
36(1b) to the Consolidated financial Statements.
Key Audit Matters
Key audit matters are those matters that, in our professional
judgement, were of most significance in our audit of the
Consolidated Financial Statements of the current period.
These matters were addressed in the context of our audit
of the Consolidated Financial Statements as a whole, and
in forming our opinion thereon, and we do not provide a
