Director report is expected to be made available to us after
the date of this auditor''s report.

y Our opinion on the Consolidated Financial Statements
does not cover the other information and will not express
any form of assurance conclusion thereon.

y In connection with our audit of the Consolidated Financial
Statements, our responsibility is to read the other
information identified above when it becomes available,
compare with the financial statements of the subsidiaries
and associate audited by the other auditors, to the extent
it relates to these entities and, in doing so, place reliance
